                "caption": "Figure 1:JVT generates videos directly in pixel space with a simple DiT-style transformer, supporting (a) class-conditioned and (b) unconditional generation. Given an initial RGB frame and a target camera trajectory, it jointly generates (c) RGB frames and disparity, visualized as (d) depth maps. These outputs yield (e) colored point clouds through geometric unprojection, without an additional reconstruction model.",
